@startuml Prototype Pattern Flow
!theme plain

title Prototype Pattern - Car Creation Flow

actor Client
participant CarFactory
participant "SEDAN_PROTOTYPE\n:Car" as SedanProto
participant "TRUCK_PROTOTYPE\n:Car" as TruckProto
participant "MINIVAN_PROTOTYPE\n:Car" as MinivanProto
participant "New Car\n:Car" as NewCar

== Car Creation Process ==

Client -> CarFactory : create_sedan(color="Red", license_plate="ABC-123")
activate CarFactory

CarFactory -> SedanProto : customize(color="Red", license_plate="ABC-123")
activate SedanProto

SedanProto -> SedanProto : _clone()
SedanProto -> NewCar : **create copy**
activate NewCar

SedanProto -> NewCar : set color = "Red"
SedanProto -> NewCar : set license_plate = "ABC-123"

NewCar --> SedanProto : return customized car
deactivate NewCar
SedanProto --> CarFactory : return new car instance
deactivate SedanProto

CarFactory --> Client : return Red Sedan (ABC-123)
deactivate CarFactory

== Protection Mechanism ==

Client -> NewCar : color = "Blue"
NewCar --> Client : ✓ Success (mutable field)

Client -> NewCar : engine_type = "V8"
NewCar --> Client : ✗ AttributeError (immutable field)

note right of NewCar
  • Cloning creates independent instances
  • Only color & license_plate are mutable
  • All technical specs are protected
  • Each car maintains its own state
end note

@enduml
